+## Medusa review snapshot (2026-10-23)
+
+The Medusa chapter is imported from the versioned canonical source
+`../interfacer-medusa/docs/review/field-guide.mjs`. That repository also contains
+a standalone bilingual HTML guide, the integration patch for this non-Git site,
+and tested implementation pins. It supersedes the old Claude-hosted Medusa artifact
+as the maintained local copy; the cloud artifact was not republished here.
